body:
**issue (broader_impact):** The loop writes only the first dictionary entry and then unconditionally breaks, silently omitting every lockfile repo after the first one. The resulting package evidence advertises coverage for those repos, but their lockfile rows are absent from the fixture and the planner can produce an incomplete impact plan.

**Triggers:** When the tracemap output contains lockfile facts for more than one repository.

**Suggested fix:** Reject multiple lockfile repositories with a nonzero error, or emit a lockfile input format that represents all repositories instead of silently dropping the remainder.

```suggestion
        if (lockfiles.Count > 1)
        {
            Console.Error.WriteLine("error: multiple lockfile repositories are not supported");
            return 1;
        }

        foreach (var (repo, rows) in lockfiles)
        {
            var lf = new LockfileRows { SchemaVersion = "lockfile-rows.v0", Repo = repo, Rows = rows };
            File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(outDir, "input", "lockfile-rows.v0.json"), JsonSerializer.Serialize(lf, WriteOpts));
        }
```

